{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13110260","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13110260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1311026001:1":{"text":"This is...!","source_cn":"这是……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4683D6A47A42F377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311026002:0":{"text":"Lower your voice! It's as I feared. The temple here is also conducting a Hypogean ritual, just like the previous two.","source_cn":"小声！果然，大修道院也和那两个小教堂一样，在举行恶魔的仪式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29BF26792B8FB276","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311026003:1":{"text":"These cultists have taken control of the temple. The Hierophant must be in danger...","source_cn":"这些邪教徒控制了大教堂内部，看来大主教凶多吉少……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C856299A2F44250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1311026003":{"text":"These cultists have taken control of the temple. The Hierophant must be in danger...","source_cn":"这些邪教徒控制了大教堂内部，看来大主教凶多吉少……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C856299A2F44250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311026004:1":{"text":"I agree. Should we sneak in quietly, we can take them by surprise.","source_cn":"嗯，我们潜入大教堂，可以出其不意，攻击他们的薄弱之处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FE48D0C3ED926C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311026005:1":{"text":"If we don't alert them, we'll have a chance at rescuing the acolytes.","source_cn":"不惊动他们的话，我们还有机会救出那些被抓起来的修士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02F6B14824DC3FA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311026008:1":{"text":"Therefore, I suggest we <style=\"highlight\">enter quietly</style> and evade any potential ambushes. It would be ideal to discover those orchestrating the ritual and neutralize them in one fell swoop.","source_cn":"我们还是<style=highlight>悄悄潜入</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3D12C4AB54C91B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1311026008":{"text":"Therefore, I suggest we <style=\"highlight\">enter quietly</style> and evade any potential ambushes. It would be ideal to discover those orchestrating the ritual and neutralize them in one fell swoop.","source_cn":"我们还是<style=highlight>悄悄潜入</style>，避开这些耳目，也躲开可能的埋伏。最好能找到举办仪式的人，一举将他们拿下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3D12C4AB54C91B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311026009:1":{"text":"Let us proceed with caution.","source_cn":"走吧，小心点，不要惊动他们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1322F4FF1989FEC